{"id":"0cda1de7c1306f96","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-lem-chain-bound.md","title":"Chain Bound Lemma","display":"lem-chain-bound — Chain Bound Lemma","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-lem-chain-bound","aliases":["58-lem-chain-bound","Chain Bound Lemma","Zorn Setup Lemma"],"display":"lem-chain-bound — Chain Bound Lemma","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-chain.md]]","[[58-df-poset]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-lem-chain-bound"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-lem-chain-bound</span><span>Chain Bound Lemma</span><span>Zorn Setup Lemma</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-chain-bound — Chain Bound Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a07664003abe8d32\" href=\"?note=a07664003abe8d32\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-chain.md\">../batch17/58-df-chain.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"58-df-poset\">58-df-poset</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq)\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq)\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"58-df-poset\">58-df-poset</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\subseteq P\">\\(C\\subseteq P\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Chain}(C,P,\\leq)\">\\(\\mathrm{Chain}(C,P,\\leq)\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a07664003abe8d32\" href=\"?note=a07664003abe8d32\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-chain.md\">../batch17/58-df-chain.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall D\\subseteq P\\;(\\mathrm{Chain}(D,P,\\leq)\\to\\exists u\\in P\\;\\forall d\\in D\\;(d\\leq u))\">\\(\\forall D\\subseteq P\\;(\\mathrm{Chain}(D,P,\\leq)\\to\\exists u\\in P\\;\\forall d\\in D\\;(d\\leq u))\\)</span>（链上界假设）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}chain\\text{-}bound} \\vdash \\Bigl(\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq)\\land\\mathrm{Chain}(C,P,\\leq)\\land\\forall D\\subseteq P\\;(\\mathrm{Chain}(D,P,\\leq)\\to\\exists v\\in P\\;\\forall d\\in D\\;(d\\leq v))\\Bigr)\\to\\exists u\\in P\\;\\forall c\\in C\\;(c\\leq u)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}chain\\text{-}bound} \\vdash \\Bigl(\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq)\\land\\mathrm{Chain}(C,P,\\leq)\\land\\forall D\\subseteq P\\;(\\mathrm{Chain}(D,P,\\leq)\\to\\exists v\\in P\\;\\forall d\\in D\\;(d\\leq v))\\Bigr)\\to\\exists u\\in P\\;\\forall c\\in C\\;(c\\leq u)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>该结论是链上界假设对指定链 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 的实例化；没有该假设时，并非每个偏序的每条链都有上界。</li>\n<li>&quot;Chain-complete&quot; here means only that every chain has an upper bound.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-chain.md","status":"resolved","id":"a07664003abe8d32","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-chain.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-poset","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-poset]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-poset","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq)$（see [[58-df-poset]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-chain.md","status":"resolved","id":"a07664003abe8d32","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$C\\subseteq P$ 且 $\\mathrm{Chain}(C,P,\\leq)$（see [[../batch17/58-df-chain.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq)","display":false},{"tex":"C\\subseteq P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Chain}(C,P,\\leq)","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall D\\subseteq P\\;(\\mathrm{Chain}(D,P,\\leq)\\to\\exists u\\in P\\;\\forall d\\in D\\;(d\\leq u))","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}chain\\text{-}bound} \\vdash \\Bigl(\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq)\\land\\mathrm{Chain}(C,P,\\leq)\\land\\forall D\\subseteq P\\;(\\mathrm{Chain}(D,P,\\leq)\\to\\exists v\\in P\\;\\forall d\\in D\\;(d\\leq v))\\Bigr)\\to\\exists u\\in P\\;\\forall c\\in C\\;(c\\leq u)","display":true},{"tex":"C","display":false}],"bytes":1091,"backlinks":[{"id":"2830b5df14164544","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3876","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-lem-chain-bound.md|58-lem-chain-bound]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":["a07664003abe8d32","d3f859dbdd37f018"]}